@startuml seq-uc6-deploy
!include plantuml-theme.puml
title UC-6 Deploy a new service version (ECS rolling deployment)
autonumber
actor "Operator\n(Terraform)" as T
participant "ECS service\nscheduler" as E
participant "Amazon ECR\nPublic" as R
participant "New task" as N
participant "Load balancer\n(ui only)" as L
participant "Old task" as X
T -> E : register task definition revision, update service
E -> N : start task (maximum 200 %)
N -> R : pull image via NAT Gateway
N --> E : container health check passes
E -> L : register new target, wait for healthy
E -> X : deregister and stop old task (minimum healthy 100 %)
note over E, N : if the new task never becomes healthy, the circuit breaker is OFF,\nso ECS keeps retrying with no rollback
@enduml
